    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5f0ade7c-41b7-59e7-8d8e-7cb1991c1ac0" activityNameId="541a6cc8-b8f1-5271-b82a-e22ab9bb465a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Steel, electric, low-alloyed, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Steel, electric, low-alloyed, at plant
Inventory for 1 kg steel, based on data from (Haupt, 2020)
economical allocation of EAF slag. Allocation factor of steel: 0.99. Remark: represents Swiss production (100 % electric arc furnace). 33.46% iron scrap from EU; 66.54% iron scrap from CH. Geography: Data relate to the plant in Switzerland UUID: e778ed60-5ec5-36e9-add5-745af0b58177
Included processes: Transports of scrap metal and other input materials to electric arc furnace, steel making process and casting.
Remark: This process produces secondary steel. Only scrap is used as iron bearing input.

Location: Switzerland
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Data from literature
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e778ed60-5ec5-36e9-add5-745af0b58177.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
